  "articleBody": "Turning a garage into a legal bedroom usually requires more than adding drywall and flooring. The space may need permits, insulation, heating, natural light, ventilation, bedroom-sized dimensions, emergency escape access, alarms, and a plan for lost parking. Existing slab height, utilities, garage-door openings, and local zoning can significantly affect the design, cost, and approval path.",
